  "description": "Reid Urban C1 | Commuter city bike\nComfortable, practical and built for everyday journeys – the ideal commuter bike for getting around town and tackling longer rides.\nThe Reid Bikes Urban C1 is designed for comfortable, reliable everyday riding, making it an ideal choice for commuting, getting around town and longer weekend rides.\nIts responsive handling and comfortable riding position make navigating busy streets and cycle paths easy, while CST 38mm tyres provide a smooth, stable ride across a range of surfaces. The Reid Bikes city comfort saddle adds extra support for longer journeys.\nA Shimano 16-speed drivetrain gives you plenty of gearing options for flat roads, hills and longer commutes, while Tektro hydraulic disc brakes provide reliable, controlled stopping in changing conditions. Double-wall rims add durability for everyday use.\nWith its versatile setup and comfortable ride, the Reid Bikes Urban C1 is built to make everyday cycling a practical alternative to shorter car journeys – from the daily commute to trips into town and weekend rides.\nThe Reid Bikes Urban C1 is ideal for:\n\nEveryday commuters looking for a comfortable and efficient way to get around town\n\nCity and urban riding, with responsive handling and a stable, smooth ride\n\nRiders tackling varied terrain, with 16-speed Shimano gearing for hills and longer rides\n\nComfort-focused cyclists, with CST 38mm tyres and a Reid city comfort saddle\n\nRiders who want reliable stopping power, with Tektro hydraulic disc brakes for confident braking\n\nLonger commutes and weekend rides, thanks to its versatile setup and stable handling\n\nAnyone looking for a practical alternative to driving, helping make everyday journeys more active and enjoyable",
